id: technique-hermit
name: Technique Hermit
kind: gear
itemType: buddy
special: true
buddyKind: greater
original: mentor-buddy
chooses: technique
hermit: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Greater Mentor Buddy: with the Signature Technique chosen, the Mentor's Combat Rolls doubled
  for that attack.
text: >
  Technique Hermit: This specialized mentor teaches you the hidden secrets of their special
  technique.
  –Special Buddy Type: Greater
  –Original Buddy: Mentor Buddy
  –Effects: Select a Signature Technique you have access to upon gaining this Buddy. If you use
  that Signature Technique, double the benefits from Mentor Buddy for the duration of that
  Attacking Maneuver.

---

# The Technique is chosen when it is given, among the character's own. Used while this is Active,
# its attack is 1(bT) higher on the Strike and the Wound again - a row of its own.
